          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. Floyd's Cycle Detection",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "==slow== moves 1 step, ==fast== moves 2 per iteration",
                "O(n) time, O(1) space",
                "{green:slow == fast} → cycle exists",
                "{red:fast or fast.next is None} → no cycle"
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "frame": "dashed",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "lang": "python",
              "lines": [
                "def has_cycle(head):",
                "    slow = fast = head",
                "    while fast and fast.next:",
                "        slow = slow.next",
                "        fast = fast.next.next",
                "        if slow is fast: return True",
                "    return False"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. Middle and Cycle Start",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "When fast hits the end, ==slow is the middle==",
                "Even length: slow lands on the **second middle**"
              ],
              "style": "dot"
            },
            {
              "type": "diagram",
              "kind": "flow",
              "spec": {
                "nodes": [
                  {
                    "text": "Meet",
                    "sub": "slow == fast",
                    "ink": "blue"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Reset",
                    "sub": "one pointer to head",
                    "ink": "orange"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Step both",
                    "sub": "1 step each",
                    "ink": "purple"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Entrance",
                    "sub": "they meet here",
                    "ink": "green"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "style": "sticky",
              "title": "Loop condition",
              "text": "Use `while fast and fast.next`, else `fast.next.next` raises a null error."
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Interview Point",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "**Why must they meet?** The gap shrinks by 1 each step inside the cycle, so it reaches 0",
                "**Cycle start?** Reset one pointer to head, move both 1 step; they meet at the entrance",
                "**First middle of an even list?** Loop while `fast.next and fast.next.next`"
              ],
              "style": "number"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
